{"h":3396,"lines":[{"t":"Test 1","y":0.036124971117766802,"w":0.061926085154215493,"c":1,"h":0.014959360039557112,"x":0.85381061987109852},{"h":0.0092409485501310229,"t":"FATHER:","w":0.057766418457031246,"x":0.076055062277067972,"c":1,"y":0.084042316407355822},{"t":"SARAH.","y":0.10029069757860753,"w":0.053497943878173845,"c":1,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"x":0.076131686398361639},{"t":"FATHER:","x":0.076131688780904844,"w":0.059670778910319022,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.11482558127733911,"c":1},{"t":"SARAH:","h":0.0090992240096992028,"x":0.076071166221874667,"c":1,"w":0.053618984222412111,"y":0.1306248065823622},{"w":0.057787469228108734,"x":0.076044537503013293,"y":0.1756199571492949,"h":0.010678690089213405,"c":1,"t":"FATHER:"},{"h":0.010253174987361668,"x":0.076116732780902835,"c":1,"t":"SARAH:","y":0.20780945899690195,"w":0.053527851104736346},{"t":"FATHER:","y":0.23818891107621076,"w":0.055668500264485679,"x":0.076075214789192033,"h":0.0090872940944137781,"c":1},{"h":0.010284019443255854,"t":"SARAH:","y":0.25430566467599092,"w":0.053539498647054012,"c":1,"x":0.076110909009719702},{"c":1,"t":"FATHER:","y":0.2688953487269371,"x":0.076131686829761236,"w":0.057613169352213528,"h":0.010174418787512463},{"w":0.055949109395345073,"t":"SARAH:","x":0.073877297596421684,"c":1,"y":0.28294227008078321,"h":0.012603831656268327},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"x":0.076131687443234786,"t":"FATHER:","y":0.29941860443255175,"w":0.057613169352213556,"c":1},{"y":0.31395348811108859,"c":1,"w":0.051440327962239588,"t":"SARAH:","x":0.076131688453722438,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"w":0.05576828002929686,"h":0.0094242107180178003,"t":"FATHER.","c":1,"y":0.33104370857702725,"x":0.076025324903474148},{"t":"SARAH:","c":1,"y":0.34593023243039145,"x":0.074074075030831535,"h":0.011627907185728703,"w":0.055555553436279312},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.17283951549544516,"w":0.4382715861002604,"c":1,"t":"Perfect. So, is it the same price as the Tiny Engineers?","y":0.08127208487772819},{"h":0.015797580229239161,"c":1,"w":0.33354100545247395,"t":"It's just a bit more: £50 for the five weeks.","x":0.17479895973155807,"y":0.096171004807973026},{"w":0.31481480916341142,"y":0.11336866909587096,"h":0.01453830777405285,"c":1,"t":"And are the classes on a Monday, too?","x":0.17489712206300387},{"w":0.64814814249674479,"y":0.12779740851684063,"t":"They used to be, but we found it didn't give our staff enough time to clear up after","x":0.17283950886266922,"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"y":0.14389534869068765,"c":1,"w":0.62962961832682285,"h":0.015998644317698818,"t":"the first workshop, so we moved them to Wednesdays. The classes are held in","x":0.17078189855446851},{"x":0.17266323075412052,"w":0.25346860249837244,"h":0.014844133940967508,"t":"the morning from ten to eleven.","c":1,"y":0.15821760801713369},{"t":"OK. That's better for me actually. And what about the location? Where exactly are","c":1,"x":0.17275341885303352,"y":0.17253337731842378,"w":0.64833414713541671,"h":0.018047917998440854},{"y":0.19040697661855743,"t":"the workshops held?","w":0.16872427622477212,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"x":0.1707818947078141},{"t":"They're in building 10A - there's a big sign on the door, you can't miss it, and","w":0.61111109415690112,"c":1,"x":0.17283951454706387,"y":0.20639534869084086,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"c":1,"y":0.21957911240416161,"x":0.17065441859074071,"w":0.29246640523274742,"h":0.015942777986380441,"t":"that's in Fradstone Industrial Estate."},{"y":0.23691860450845248,"w":0.055555553436279298,"t":"Sorry?","h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.17283950712564003,"c":1},{"t":"Fradstone - that's F-R-A-D-S-T-O-N-E.","y":0.25145348822297797,"x":0.17283950889286104,"w":0.31481480916341148,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1},{"y":0.26737338055887405,"h":0.01472320376914027,"c":1,"x":0.17078188976156605,"w":0.24279836018880208,"t":"And that's in Grasford, isn't it?"},{"t":"Yes, up past the station.","y":0.28188163769164143,"w":0.19589639027913414,"c":1,"x":0.172627944281114,"h":0.01617858603649347},{"y":0.29796511614415422,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"And will I have any parking problems there?","c":1,"w":0.35185185750325521,"x":0.17078189007553288},{"y":0.31389870418572263,"t":"No, there's always plenty available. So would you like to enrol Lydia and Carly now?","h":0.016043156420524562,"w":0.64814814249674479,"x":0.17078189572726388,"c":1},{"h":0.015757114783333082,"c":1,"y":0.34293507195162742,"x":0.17265623428656046,"t":"So can I have your full name ...","w":0.24934478759765627},{"y":0.22093023238112486,"t":"Q9","x":0.84979423843261614,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.028806584676106861},{"t":"Q10","c":1,"x":0.84567901157561876,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.29796511610570486,"w":0.039094651540120373},{"c":1,"h":0.016761249591661143,"y":0.39205542156025586,"t":"PART 2","w":0.10311580657958984,"x":0.076014112592601532},{"t":"Good morning, everyone, and welcome to Stevenson's, one of the country's major","h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.65226338704427078,"y":0.42137809202717791,"x":0.078189294026641293,"c":1},{"t":"manufacturers of metal goods. Thank you for choosing us for your two weeks of work","w":0.67695475260416671,"y":0.43749999988030175,"h":0.013081395583944833,"x":0.076131677099049999,"c":1},{"x":0.076075169138290447,"y":0.45136171718858731,"t":"experience. My name is Julia Simmons, and since the beginning of this year I've been the","w":0.71205271402994785,"h":0.016434943577706917,"c":1},{"t":"managing director.","y":0.46674047714647127,"w":0.15078141530354816,"h":0.015937412585470767,"x":0.075849734948963465,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.076131698726961572,"w":0.70164606730143231,"y":0.49116607777521359,"t":"Stevenson's is quite an old company. Like me, the founder, Ronald Stevenson, went into","h":0.013250883392226132},{"y":0.50726744172772487,"c":1,"t":"the steel industry when he left school - that was in 1923. He set up this company when he","x":0.074074082760460361,"w":0.72016459147135414,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"y":0.51997256417903459,"x":0.073955264980195737,"t":"finished his apprenticeship, in 1926, although he actually started making plans two years","h":0.018539462409676521,"w":0.70599543253580721,"c":1},{"x":0.076131696564581741,"w":0.4382715861002604,"h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.53769140141062099,"c":1,"t":"earlier, in 1924. He was a very determined young man!"},{"h":0.014853220244318899,"c":1,"y":0.55934653532358192,"x":0.076082357728704822,"t":"Stevenson's long-term plan was to manufacture components for the machine tools industry -","w":0.73877538045247393},{"y":0.57245747504330913,"w":0.70801712036132813,"t":"although in fact that never came about - and for the automotive industry, that is, cars and","x":0.076046281277318814,"h":0.018062096181269638,"c":1},{"t":"lorries. However, there was a delay of five years before that happened, because shortly","w":0.69753087361653654,"y":0.59156976729578303,"h":0.015988372380376759,"x":0.072016456091112624,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"before the company went into production, Stevenson was given the opportunity to make","w":0.69753087361653643,"x":0.0761316823256971,"h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.60600706735596188},{"h":0.01453830777405285,"x":0.074074063608036714,"c":1,"t":"goods for hospitals and other players in the healthcare industry, so that's what we did for the","y":0.62209302312292758,"w":0.73456792195638021},{"w":0.12014225006103516,"x":0.073664814604251866,"t":"first five years.","h":0.014063838513916904,"c":1,"y":0.63701457217157587},{"h":0.016055389062816339,"c":1,"y":0.65977194235585324,"t":"Over the years, we've expanded the premises considerably - we were lucky that the site is","x":0.074024126994802555,"w":0.72231648763020839},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.07613167864911749,"t":"big enough, so moving to a new location has never been necessary. However, the layout is","c":1,"y":0.67579505307954302,"w":0.72222223917643225},{"h":0.015663259301786581,"x":0.074004519884393855,"y":0.69005743552888943,"c":1,"t":"far from ideal for modern machinery and production methods, so we intend to carry out major","w":0.74293492635091152},{"c":1,"w":0.39736091613769531,"x":0.071916988661584844,"t":"refurbishment of this site over the next five years.","y":0.70478745937258003,"h":0.016410779335192638},{"x":0.074023760734555133,"t":"I'd better give you some idea of what you'll be doing during your two weeks with us, so you","h":0.015336547779671861,"y":0.72901498225584682,"w":0.7223251851399739,"c":1},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.074074071752295079,"c":1,"y":0.74558303881456489,"w":0.73662551879882809,"t":"know what to expect. Most mornings you'll have a presentation from one of the managers, to"},{"t":"learn about their department, starting this morning with research and development. And you'll","w":0.74086669921875004,"h":0.015401998594034683,"c":1,"y":0.75942936585996057,"x":0.073999978416062887},{"y":0.77616279057703541,"t":"all spend some time in each department, observing what's going on and talking to people - as","w":0.73868311564127609,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.076131693038803683,"c":1},{"t":"long as you don't stop them from doing their work altogether! In the past, a teacher from your","w":0.74085993448893228,"c":1,"y":0.79032873907312806,"x":0.074009226739770881,"h":0.015747904917938316},{"w":0.72039179484049487,"t":"school has come in at the end of each week to find out how the group were getting on, but","h":0.019255313491371995,"c":1,"x":0.073976029961062478,"y":0.80245121500784589},{"w":0.37037038167317704,"x":0.074074068333032136,"y":0.82267441848062151,"t":"your school isn't able to arrange that this year.","c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"t":"Q11","c":1,"x":0.84362139957107729,"y":0.50726744170203208,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"x":0.84362139840689454,"y":0.60755813939619185,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"Q12","w":0.039094651540120373,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Q13","x":0.84362139979335971,"y":0.67587209286482275,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"t":"Q14","h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.74563953472769251,"w":0.037037035624186143,"c":1,"x":0.84362139978655137},{"t":"OK, now I'll briefly help you to orientate yourselves around the site. As you can see, we're","x":0.076069649262823211,"y":0.86622094380207937,"c":1,"h":0.017298695617064763,"w":0.70998911539713538},{"y":0.88220162701588256,"c":1,"w":0.71200805664062505,"t":"in the reception area, which we try to make attractive and welcoming to visitors. There's a","h":0.015948747156365628,"x":0.074036796920940923},{"x":0.88477366208429731,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.90843023236696219,"c":1,"t":"99","w":0.026748971939086985},{"h":0.026961803997925027,"x":0.71953505123403827,"c":1,"w":0.25425483703613283,"y":0.95563152810358609,"t":"IELTSXpress.com"}],"w":2400}